<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Assessment Invitation</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f7f7f7; color: #333; }
      .container { max-width: 560px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
      .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 6px 14px; background: #e8f5e9; color: #2e7d32; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
      .info-box { background: #f0f4ff; border-left: 4px solid #007bff; padding: 14px 18px; border-radius: 4px; margin: 20px 0; }
      .info-box p { margin: 6px 0; font-size: 14px; }
      .footer { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 12px; color: #888; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="badge">New Assessment Invitation</div>
      <h2>You've Been Invited!</h2>
      <p>Hello <strong><%= candidateName %></strong>,</p>
      <p>You have been invited to take the following assessment:</p>
      <div class="info-box">
        <p><strong>Assessment:</strong> <%= assessmentTitle %></p>
        <p><strong>Duration:</strong> <%= durationMinutes %> minutes</p>
        <p><strong>Expires:</strong> <%= expiresAt %></p>
      </div>
      <p>Please log in to your account and use your invitation token to begin the assessment.</p>
      <p><strong>Invitation Token:</strong> <code><%= inviteToken %></code></p>
      <p>Good luck!</p>
      <div class="footer">&copy; Developer Assessment Platform. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
